{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301290","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130129001:1":{"text":"小さいからこそ美味しいのさ！実はここの魚はエサが少なくて、大きく育たないんだ。","source_cn":"小的才好吃！其实是它们也没什么吃的，长不太大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CEFB47D74924D80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130129002:1":{"text":"でもこれで十分だよ。食べ物が少ない時は、この小魚たちが僕たちの主食になるんだ。","source_cn":"但我们已经很感激了，没有太多食物的时候，小鱼就是我们主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB860AC8271133332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130129003:1":{"text":"だから感謝の気持ちを忘れずに、きれいに食べるんだよ！","source_cn":"所以我们都会带着虔诚的心，一点不剩地吃掉它呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD31589BF03BBCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血赞多尔":{"text":"ババリアのザンドラ","source":"小蛮血赞多尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}